            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=tree&arg=376a5f3c-c598-40ee-95ad-5db9046ab8e2",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Idades\n\nNosso conhecimento sobre o passado da humanidade, do planeta e do universo é algo novo. Mas isso não significa que, antes, não tentamos explicá-lo de maneira poética.\n\nPor exemplo, na lista dos reis sumérios, que contém reis reais e outros nunca comprovados, é dito que, em diferentes cidades, houve 8 reis que, juntos, governaram 241.200 anos, sendo que um deles governou por 43.200 anos.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<img src=\"https://www.historytracers.org/images/Ashmolean/KingList.jpg\" />",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Lista dos Reis Sumérios. © Ashmolean Museum, University of Oxford.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "a6b3df3d-c1d2-4897-a567-508887dbb8b1",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "a6b3df3d-c1d2-4897-a567-508887dbb8b1",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "cb216fdf-1282-42e0-aaf4-3547b53857d7",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al.",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/c211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 0,
               "uuid": "c8dd380c-6f66-415c-94fa-b116308adeef",
               "text": "Black, J.A. et al. (Tradução)",
               "page": "https://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/section2/tr211.htm",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "1998",
                  "month": "",
